      "message": "`ScaleSlope()` sets `dy` by either\n\n```\n    *dy \u003d FixedDiv(src_height, dst_height);\n```\n\nor\n\n```\n      *dy \u003d FixedDiv1(src_height, dst_height);\n```\n\nSince `src_height` is strictly smaller than `dst_height`, `dy` cannot possibly be equal to `65536` (1.0). Therefore this assertion should be `assert(dy \u003c 65536)`.",
      "revId": "3f42e3840b88a36fe579c0488ee2b843ea81cf17",
